<%- include('../partials/head', { title: '로그인', bodyClass: '' }) %>
<main class="wrap page">
  <div class="auth-hero">
    <img src="/static/img/logo-wide.jpg" alt="GINGMOJI">
    <p>로그인하면 다음 주문부터 정보 입력 없이 바로 결제돼요</p>
  </div>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="stack">
      <a class="btn big block kakao" href="/auth/kakao">카카오로 시작하기</a>
      <a class="btn big block google" href="/auth/google">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#FFC107" d="M43.6 20.5H42V20H24v8h11.3C33.7 32.7 29.2 36 24 36c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12s5.4-12 12-12c3.1 0 5.8 1.2 7.9 3.1l5.7-5.7C34 6.1 29.3 4 24 4 12.9 4 4 12.9 4 24s8.9 20 20 20 20-8.9 20-20c0-1.3-.1-2.4-.4-3.5z"/><path fill="#FF3D00" d="m6.3 14.7 6.6 4.8C14.7 15.1 19 12 24 12c3.1 0 5.8 1.2 7.9 3.1l5.7-5.7C34 6.1 29.3 4 24 4 16.3 4 9.7 8.3 6.3 14.7z"/><path fill="#4CAF50" d="M24 44c5.2 0 9.9-2 13.4-5.2l-6.2-5.2C29.2 35.1 26.7 36 24 36c-5.2 0-9.6-3.3-11.3-8l-6.5 5C9.5 39.6 16.2 44 24 44z"/><path fill="#1976D2" d="M43.6 20.5H42V20H24v8h11.3c-.8 2.2-2.2 4.2-4.1 5.6l6.2 5.2C37 39.2 44 34 44 24c0-1.3-.1-2.4-.4-3.5z"/></svg>
        구글로 시작하기</a>
    </div>
    <div class="or">또는 아이디로 로그인</div>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="err-box"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/login">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <label class="field"><span>아이디</span><input name="login_id" value="<%= form.login_id || '' %>" required autocapitalize="none" autocorrect="off" autocomplete="username"></label>
      <label class="field"><span>비밀번호</span><input name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label>
      <button class="btn big block" type="submit">로그인</button>
    </form>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">처음이신가요? <a class="link" href="/signup">아이디로 회원가입</a></p>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
